    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Number of risk-informed development strategies and plans developed or revised at: (a) national level, (c) sub-national level, and (c) sectoral level that incorporate gender responsive disaster and climate risk management.</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support the review of national/subnational/sectoral development strategies, policies, or legislative frameworks to integrate disaster and climate risk management in a coherent, gender-responsive, and integrated manner</narrative>
    </description>
